/blogs/kanemura.miku/2019-10-15/31253_1.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_1503.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(69, 69, 69); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">ポチャッコ〜</span><span class=\"s3\">♡</span><span class=\"s1\">かわいいです！ありがとう！</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(69, 69, 69); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">水色の優しいお花！ありがとう！</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(69, 69, 69); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">ビビットピンクのきらびやかなお花</span><span class=\"s2\">😆</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(69, 69, 69); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">豪華な色とりどりの花束</span><span class=\"s2\">💐</span><span class=\"s1\">すごい！</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(69, 69, 69); min-height: 20.3px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(69, 69, 69); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s3\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2019-10-15/31253_2.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_1504.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(69, 69, 69); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">ふわふわの羽とバラが可愛いお花</span><span class=\"s2\">🌹💖</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(69, 69, 69); -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">プリンセスみたいなお花</span><span class=\"s2\">👸</span><span class=\"s1\">写真まで嬉しい！</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; color: rgb(69, 69, 69); min-height: 20.3px; -webkit-text-size-adju